  Name: "Titanium Ti-6Al-4V annealed"
  Description: "Titanium Grade 5 (Ti-6Al-4V, UNS R56400), mill annealed: light, strong CNC parts. Strengths are AMS 4911 minimums, 130 ksi UTS and 120 ksi yield, elongation 10 % (typical: yield 880 MPa, UTS 950 MPa, elongation 14 %). Poor heat conductor; galls against itself."
  ReferenceSource: "AMS 4911 minimum strengths (annealed sheet, strip, plate); ASM/MatWeb typical elastic and thermal values"
